-- `hub` re-exports two unrelated `mth : a -> Int`, from `IA` (one impl, at `Int`) and
-- `IB` (one impl, at `Bool`).  SHADOW-SEMANTICS.md S2-DECL (d) over the admitted set
-- (ruled 2026-10-14) decides each occurrence by its own receiver: at `True` only
-- `IB Bool` selects (7), at `1` only `IA Int` selects (2).  Spec answer: `7` then `2`
-- on every verb, the built binary included.
import hub.{IA, IB, mth}

main =
  let _ = println (mth True)
  println (mth 1)
